{"product_id":"fleas","title":"Fleas","description":"\u003cp\u003eMeet Dirty Bertie - a boy with nose-pickingly disgusting habits! He's full to bursting with madcap plans and crazy ideas, and if it's trouble you're after, look no further - Bertie's sure to be up to his neck in it. Join Bertie as he takes a flea-ridden Whiffer to the vet, does a naughty dare at school and gets a ride in shiny red fire engine!\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 129 x 198\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Alan MacDonald | David Roberts\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9781847150059\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 95\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookloopbook.com","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45890761293977,"sku":"14RC9781847150059","price":10.0,"currency_code":"$","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/69156db4f39a6_Fleas.jpg?v=1763046302","url":"https:\/\/bookloopbook.com\/products\/fleas","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}